---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import MediaText from '../components/MediaText.astro';
import Facilities from '../components/Facilities.astro';
import { portalHref } from '../config/integrations';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

// Same applicant registration the homepage hero points at.
const applyHref = portalHref('entrance') ?? '/admissions';
const applyAttrs = applyHref.startsWith('http') ? { rel: 'noopener' } : {};
import introPhoto from '../assets/images/engagedlearners.jpg';
import earlyPhoto from '../assets/images/outdoorplay.jpg';
import primaryPhoto from '../assets/images/collaborative-study.jpg';
import juniorPhoto from '../assets/images/sciencepupils.jpg';
import seniorPhoto from '../assets/images/labsciencestudents.jpg';
import libraryPhoto from '../assets/images/librarysection.jpg';

// Four stage cards across, so each one is roughly a quarter of the container
// rather than the third the three-card layouts elsewhere ask for.
const cardSizes = '(max-width: 820px) 92vw, (max-width: 1080px) 46vw, 23vw';
---
<Layout
  title={`Academics-${site.name}`}
  description="British EYFS and Montessori in the Nursery, and the Nigerian Curriculum enriched with Cambridge from Primary to Senior Secondary, taught in small, focused classes at Mt Cedar British International School, Benin City."
  active="academics"
>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Academics</p>
    <h1>A clear path from first steps to school leaver.</h1>
    <p>The British EYFS with Montessori in the Nursery, then the Nigerian Curriculum enriched with Cambridge from Primary to Senior Secondary, taught by caring teachers in small, focused classes.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<MediaText
  image={introPhoto}
  alt="Engaged Mt Cedar learners in a bright classroom"
  eyebrow="Our Approach"
  title="Where curiosity meets rigour."
>
  <p>At Mt Cedar, learning is active and personal. Small classes mean every child is known, challenged at the right level, and supported to reach further than they thought they could.</p>
  <p>We pair British academic standards with warm, attentive teaching; so pupils build not just knowledge, but the confidence and habits to keep growing.</p>
</MediaText>

<section class="academics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Our Programmes</p><h2>Every stage, thoughtfully designed.</h2><p>Four connected stages that carry each child from playful early learning to confident, examination-ready study.</p></div>
    <div class="prog four">
      <div class="pcard has-media">
        <div class="pcard-media"><Image src={earlyPhoto} alt="Young children at outdoor play" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes={cardSizes} format="webp" quality={72} loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="pcard-in"><div class="age">Ages 2–5</div><h3>Nursery</h3><p>The British EYFS combined with Montessori education: a warm, play-led start where curiosity, language and independence take shape through structured discovery.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard has-media">
        <div class="pcard-media"><Image src={primaryPhoto} alt="Primary pupils in collaborative study" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes={cardSizes} format="webp" quality={72} loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="pcard-in"><div class="age">Ages 5–11</div><h3>Primary</h3><p>The Nigerian Curriculum enriched with Cambridge, building strong foundations in literacy, numeracy and enquiry alongside the arts, science and sport.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard has-media">
        <div class="pcard-media"><Image src={juniorPhoto} alt="Junior secondary pupils working on a science project" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes={cardSizes} format="webp" quality={72} loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="pcard-in"><div class="age">JSS 1–3</div><h3>Junior Secondary</h3><p>A broad, demanding programme with specialist subject teachers, where laboratory work and independent study begin in earnest.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pcard has-media">
        <div class="pcard-media"><Image src={seniorPhoto} alt="Senior secondary students at work in the science laboratory" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes={cardSizes} format="webp" quality={72} loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="pcard-in"><div class="age">SS 1–3</div><h3>Senior Secondary</h3><p>Examination-ready study across the sciences, arts and commercial subjects, stretching able minds and preparing students for the wider world.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<MediaText
  image={libraryPhoto}
  alt="The library at Mt Cedar British International School"
  eyebrow="Beyond the Textbook"
  title="A curriculum that goes further."
  reverse={true}
  background="var(--surface-2)"
>
  <p>Reading, research and independent thinking sit at the heart of a Mt Cedar education. Our library and learning spaces give pupils room to explore ideas, follow their questions, and build a genuine love of learning.</p>
  <p>Specialist lessons in the arts, science and sport round out a broad, balanced education for every stage.</p>
  <p>Lesson summaries and practice questions carry that work home through the <a href="/portal">Mt Cedar Portal</a>, and assessments run there too, marked promptly so teachers can act on what a child actually needs.</p>
</MediaText>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why Mt Cedar</p><h2>How we teach.</h2><p>British rigour, small classes, and a genuine knowledge of every child.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-grid">
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 19V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13"/><path d="M6 17h12v4H6a2 2 0 0 1 0-4Z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>EYFS, Cambridge and the National Curriculum</h3>
        <p>Internationally recognised standards enriching the Nigerian Curriculum, so your child is at home here and recognised anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3 20a6 6 0 0 1 12 0"/><path d="M16 6a3 3 0 0 1 0 6"/><path d="M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-3-5.2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Small, Focused Classes</h3>
        <p>Low pupil-to-teacher ratios mean lessons move at the right pace and no child is left behind.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feat">
        <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2 3 7v6c0 5 3.5 8 9 9 5.5-1 9-4 9-9V7l-9-5Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Strong Pastoral Care</h3>
        <p>We know each learner as an individual, supporting wellbeing and character alongside academic progress.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Facilities
  background="var(--surface-2)"
  title="Learning you can put your hands on."
  intro="Well equipped Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Computer laboratories, a music studio, a stocked library and sports facilities, so lessons are practised, not only taught."
/>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-300)">Admissions Open</p>
    <h2>Find the right stage for your child.</h2>
    <p>Talk to us about your child’s year group and what a place at Mt Cedar could look like for your family.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href={applyHref} {...applyAttrs}>Apply for a Place <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/contact">Ask a Question</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
